# Attuned Hunter only counts "during your turn": on Bot2's turn 2 Bot2 exiles Bot1's graveyard (a spent Black Lotus) with Tormod's Crypt, and the 3/3 stays a 3/3.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Attuned Hunter
Island x18

[Bot2 Deck]
Tormod's Crypt
Island x19

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Hand.Attuned Hunter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Tormod's Crypt.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Tormod's Crypt.Activate(Bot1)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 0
Bot1.Battlefield.Attuned Hunter.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = (absent)
Bot1.Battlefield.Attuned Hunter.Power = 3
